{title: 553 - Jesus, Guide Our Way}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #553 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 553}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]Jesus, [D]guide [G]our [D]way
[Em]To eternal [C]day:
[G/D]So [D7]shall [G]we, no [D7/A]more [Bm]delaying,
[G]Follow [D]Thee, [G]Thy [D]voice [Em]obeying:
[G]Lead us by [F#dim]the hand
[Em]To our [Bm]Father's land.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G]When we [D]danger meet
[Em]Steadfast make [C]our feet;
[G/D]Lord, preserve us uncomplaining
[G]Mid the darkness [F#dim]round us reigning:
[Em]Through adversity lies our way [Bm]to Thee.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[G]Order [D]all [G]our [D]way
[Em]Through the mortal [C]day:
[G/D]In our [D7]toil, [G]with aid [D7/A]be [Bm]near [D7/A]us:
[G]In our [D]need, [G]with [D]succour [Em]cheer [F#dim]us:
[G]Till we safely [F#dim]stand
[Em]In our [Bm]Father's land.
{end_of_verse}
